3. webos3_compat.cpp and udev_compat.c are written for legacy-webos from the
   public interfaces of the libraries they stand in for (luna-service2,
   libwebosi18n's ResBundle, pbnjson, SQLite, libudev); no code is copied.

Packages built with COMPAT_WEBOS3=1 may also bundle Debian's libwebp7,
libwebpdemux2 and libsharpyuv0 (BSD-3-Clause), fetched by setup.sh.
